# Frontend — see docs/09_Codebase/04_Frontend_Map.md, 09_Frontend_Routes.md
- React + Vite + Tailwind. Dev API calls go through the Vite proxy (RULE-19).
- Frontend types use the exact backend DTO names (RULE-20).
- Use existing components (`modules/camp/components/ui.tsx`); do NOT add a new UI library.
- All UI text via i18n (mn/en/zh) — no hard-coded strings. New page: `04_Frontend_Map` §6; translations: §4.
